  "description": "Her Confession is a creamy and elegant gourmand fragrance that blends warm spices, soft florals, and rich vanilla sweetness into a luxurious feminine scent. The fragrance feels sensual, cozy, and sophisticated while maintaining a smooth modern warmth throughout the wear. The opening introduces cinnamon and mystical accords, creating a warm spicy sweetness with an inviting sensual character. The heart develops into jasmine, tuberose, incense, and Mahonial™, adding creamy white floral richness balanced by smoky aromatic depth. The base settles into vanilla, tonka bean, musk, and cedarwood, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels addictive, elegant, and comforting. Her Confession is perfect for women who enjoy warm floral gourmand fragrances with vanilla sweetness and smooth musky woods.",
